    "function": "Might be involved in fluoroquinolone resistance. Inhibits ATP-independent DNA relaxation, ATP-dependent DNA supercoiling and ATP-dependent decatenation by endogenous gyrase, 50% inhibition occurs at 2 uM; inhibition is abolished if GyrA is mutated (Asp-87 to Gly or His). Also inhibits fluoroquinolone-promoted dsDNA cleavage. Increases fluoroquinolone (ciprofloxacin or moxifloxacin) inhibition of gyrase supercoiling activity in a concentration-dependent manner. Inhibits DNA relaxation and supercoiling by E.coli gyrase. Forms a structure that exhibits size, shape and electrostatic similarity to ",
